@prefix cieoall: <https://w3id.org/cieo#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:     <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:     <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix vann:    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/> .

<https://w3id.org/cieo>
    a owl:Ontology ;
    owl:versionIRI <https://w3id.org/cieo/0.1.0> ;
    dcterms:title "CIEO — Construction Inspection Evidence Ontology"@en ;
    dcterms:description """An evidence-aware ontology for construction inspection.

CIEO represents regulatory inspection requirements, the construction process they are scoped to,
the BIM and site geometry they target, the visual observations offered as evidence, and — its
distinguishing element — the observation conditions under which that evidence was gathered, so
that a decision can be withheld when the evidence was never capable of settling the question.

The seven modules may be imported independently. This file imports all of them plus the ifcOWL
alignment, and is the entry point for a full reasoning run.

Module map:
  core          shared upper terms, datatypes, the PROV spine
  construction  project, phases, transient site zones, physical elements
  regulation    sources, clauses, normative requirements, temporal validity of law
  inspection    requirements, targets, items, and the evidence-pattern typology
  observation   viewpoints, detections, explicit non-detections, spatial grounding
  evidence      observation conditions, calibrated detectability, evidence sufficiency
  compliance    inspection states, decisions, human verification, traceability
  profile       jurisdiction profiles, clause bindings, asset types, work stages

Load order matters only for tools without owl:imports resolution; the dependency graph is
core <- construction <- regulation <- inspection <- observation <- evidence <- compliance,
with profile depending on core, regulation and inspection."""@en ;
    vann:preferredNamespacePrefix "cieo" ;
    dcterms:created "2026-09-10"^^xsd:date ;
    dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> ;
    owl:imports <https://w3id.org/cieo/core> ,
                <https://w3id.org/cieo/construction> ,
                <https://w3id.org/cieo/regulation> ,
                <https://w3id.org/cieo/inspection> ,
                <https://w3id.org/cieo/observation> ,
                <https://w3id.org/cieo/evidence> ,
                <https://w3id.org/cieo/compliance> ,
                <https://w3id.org/cieo/profile> ,
                <https://w3id.org/cieo/ifc-alignment> .
